Error [E0201]: `r` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> move_from_borrowed_field.jet:18:14
    |
 18 |     taken := ^r.session
    |              ^
 Why: Read and write parameters and named windows keep ownership with their source
 Fix: Copy the value with `~`, or accept it with the move marker `^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
